### =====================================================================
### CLIENTES — GET /clientes, GET /clientes/:id, PATCH /:id/status,
### GET /clientes/:id/resumo
### Usa o cliente_empresa criado em 00-seed.sql (clienteId no env).
### =====================================================================

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "{{cnpj}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "senha": "{{senha}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Listar clientes da empresa, paginado (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar clientes — paginação inválida (422, pageSize > 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes?page=1&pageSize=500
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar cliente por id (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar cliente — id inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumo do cliente — saldo de pontos, histórico etc. (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}/resumo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inativar cliente (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "inativo"
}

### Reativar cliente — necessário para os testes de compras/resgates (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ativo"
}

### Atualizar status — valor fora do enum (422)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "banido"
}

### Listar clientes — sem token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes
